You link your weapons and shield to your steam generators, using them to load ammunition and improve the power of your weapons.

Each time you fire your Steamgun, you have a [16%, 39%, 52%, 61%, 68% (TL1-5)] chance to reload 1 Heavy Weapon ammo.

Each time you fire a Heavy Weapon you reload [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] ammo.

Each time you raise your shield to block, you reload 1 Heavy Weapon ammo.

This also increases weapon damage by [29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66% (TL1-5)] and Physical Power by 30 when using steamguns or heavy weapons.

In addition, your steamgun and heavy weapon shots now bypass friendly targets harmlessly.
